null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current plan; retain these exact titles and order, update status only:\n[{\"title\": \"Read three required files\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"Read complete mechanisms\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Write notes\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Edit three files\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Verify with pytest\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Course progress (new evidence below can satisfy pending items):\n{\"phase\": \"edit\", \"next_requirement\": \"remaining source changes: deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py, deepinfer/environ.py, deepinfer/logger.py\", \"remaining_count\": 3, \"requests_left\": 5, \"baseline_done\": 1, \"changed_files\": [], \"verified_current\": 0, \"required_checks\": 1, \"unseen_evidence_count\": 0}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": {"thought": "The last code block failed due to a parsing issue. I need to continue the edits. Let me read the three files again to get fresh hashes and craft precise replacements.", "code": "e = read_file(\"deepinfer/environ.py\")\nl = read_file(\"deepinfer/logger.py\")\ns = read_file(\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\")\nprint(e['file_hash'], l['file_hash'], s['file_hash'])\nprint('LEN', len(e['content']), len(l['content']), len(s['content']))"}}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\nfe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218 5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8 9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\nLEN 8304 5534 19925\nLast output from code