rd.msg/args. _setup_logger creates handler once, always resets formatter with NewLineFormatter(_FORMAT, datefmt, use_color) - add max_message_chars=envs.DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS there. init_logger attaches _default_handler if not already present. stats_logger._log_worker iterates queue batches, calls logger.info(m) per message; change to logger.info(m, extra={'keep_full_message': True})."}]}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "max_tokens": 4096, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}, "stop": ["Observation:", "Calling tools:"], "thinking": {"type": "disabled"}}, "chars": 22397, "content_chars": 21188, "course_content_chars": 22124}
